Hi,

I looked for a list of cdrom drives that are known to work
with DEC computers. Especially it should be possible to boot
of these cdroms. I did not found one, so if there is really
no such list, why not compile one?
So, if you have ever used or bootet of a non-DEC cdrom
please mail me some info.
I will post the URL of the list later, if you can call
it a list, so please contriute.
Some useful information would be:

vendor and exact model number,

How did you use this drive? e.g. booting, using it with an
already working DEC etc.

The hardware, you have used it with,

The operating system, you have used/installed,

problems you encoutered.

If you can't remember some of the above points, just tell what
you know. Please contribute. The question "What cdrom drives
work with DEC?" seems to be quiet common and a special
problem.

thanks
Dennis



