    BN24H  MMJ   RJ45
            1-----8
            2-----2
            3-----1
            4-----3
            5-----6
            6-----7

    BN24J  MMJ   RJ45
            1-----7
            2-----6
            3-----3
            4-----1
            5-----2
            6-----8

  The RJ45 serial line connection is also sometimes known as "MP8".

